{"unit_id":"tag:02Y2:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设<MATH_0001>为范畴（category）。唯一的<MATH_0002>-态射（morphisms）（在集合（sets）纤维的范畴（categories）之间）是恒等态射（identities）。换言之，<MATH_0003>-范畴（category）（其对象为集合（sets）纤维的范畴（categories））是一个范畴（category）。此外，存在范畴等价（equivalence of categories）\n<MATHSEG_0001>预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0002>以集合（sets）为值，其底为<MATHSEG_0003>范畴（categories）的范畴（category）<MATHSEG_0004>以集合（sets）为纤维，其底为<MATHSEG_0005>\n从左到右的函子（functor）是构造<MATH_0004>，它在例<REF_0001>中讨论。从右到左的函子（functor）将<MATH_0005>对应到对象（objects）的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0006>。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等态射"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"底范畴及函子范畴，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"集合纤维范畴，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"二态射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"identities","target_term":"恒等态射","context":"唯一的二态射，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"纤维和预层值，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"equivalence of categories","target_term":"范畴等价","context":"两类构造之间的等价，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"等价左端的预层，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"两个方向的函子，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"对象预层，译法待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"右到左的构造，译法待决。"}],"notes":[]}
